# DEFEND THE HOLDING (ROADMAP slice 2 step 4), on the real keys: shutters put up
# over the beds out of wood, scrap and rag, the bench plate put on, a clerk that
# reads the place, the warning that sends the people in behind the boards, and a
# raid that goes off with nobody.
#
#   TOUR_TIMEOUT=600 TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/defend.tour --seed=1 --hour=16 --weather=clear:0 --attention=0.72 --held=axe_felling --holding=hut,bunk,plot,hearth --give=timber:4,scrap:2,rag:2,kit_plate:1
#
# --holding stands a lived-in holding (hut, bunk, a plot somebody works, a lit
# hearth to be read by) and
# --attention puts it at the raid line; nothing is sent until something reads
# it, so the clerk in frame 03 is still what brings the raid.
zoom 10
coast calm
wait 0.6
# The boards over the beds, out of what he carries.
tap holding
await app:holding 4
choose build_shutters
tap use
await made 8
wait 0.4
shot 01-shutters-on-the-beds with app:holding
tap pause
wait 0.6
shot 02-boards-over-a-bed with holding, piece:shutters
# The plate Rook paid in is on his back (kit is worn as it comes into the bag).
await plate_on 3
# A clerk reads the place, and the warning comes.
spawn clerk
await noticed 10
shot 03-a-clerk-reads-the-holding with mob:clerk, holding
await warned 30
await went_in 5
wait 1.0
shot 04-they-go-in-behind-the-shutters with holding
# They come at dusk, and the night is let go by (a raid stands for RaidStage
# MINUTES): whatever came tore at the boards and went.
hour 19.4
wait 1.6
await raid 20
await party 20
# He goes out to meet one, and the plate Rook paid in takes a quarter of every
# blow it lands on him (FightRules.PLATE_TURNS).
try 25
  walkto part 1.4
  tap swing
  await ring 1.4
end
await plated 20
shot 05-the-plate-takes-its-share with mob, plated
hour 23
wait 1.5
await raid_ended 60
await kept_in 5
wait 1.0
shot 06-everybody-comes-out with holding
